('What is Family Organization?', 'Family Organization is the part of family life that covers keeping the whole household — schedules, tasks, and information — in one shared place. Bubaly handles it as the AI Family Operating System: instead of living in your head or scattered across apps, it becomes one shared, always-current system your whole family can see. Bubaly''s AI assistant doesn''t just answer questions — it takes action, turning what you ask into real calendar events, lists, reminders, and tasks.', 'Family Organization', '/features', 'what_is', 'published', 89, now(), jsonb_build_object('seed','aeo_v1','topic','family organization','category','Organization','cluster','family organization')),
